# Records demo.gif: `vhs .github/assets/demo.tape` from the repository root
# after `npm ci`. No provider request, no API key (offline fake gateway).
Output .github/assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 520
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "npm run -s example:offline"
Enter
Sleep 6s
